1
00:00:00,480 --> 00:00:05,400
Ugh, Night—
he promised and still bailed on me.

2
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:10,040
Why are you walking so fast, Earth?

3
00:00:14,160 --> 00:00:19,039
Such bad luck…
Night couldn't even come to drop you off.

4
00:00:19,720 --> 00:00:25,039
Uh…

5
00:00:25,279 --> 00:00:28,320
So you're really moving out?

6
00:00:31,199 --> 00:00:38,559
- Thanks… now go. Go on.
- You're really moving out?

7
00:00:38,559 --> 00:00:46,440
Then… take my precious baby with you.
Hug it, okay?

8
00:00:51,120 --> 00:00:52,292
I'll come visit.

9
00:00:53,093 --> 00:00:54,410
No, don't.

10
00:00:54,410 --> 00:00:58,117
- I said I'll come visit.
- Go. Go!

11
00:00:58,400 --> 00:01:03,558
I'll come visit!
I'm going! I'm going!

12
00:01:05,880 --> 00:01:09,280
- I'll come back again.
- DON'T come back!

13
00:01:09,280 --> 00:01:11,479
- I'll come again, okay?
- SAID don't come!

14
00:01:11,479 --> 00:01:14,799
Yeah, yeah…

15
00:01:18,600 --> 00:01:21,158
Hey—you still haven't
paid for the booze, Gun!
